Tag Name    : PACK_LINE_RUNTIME_SINCE_FAILURE_MIN
Data Type   : Double
Folder Path : PackLine
Unit        : min
Description : Filler run time since its wear was last reset, in plant minutes. Accrues only while the filler is running. Resets to 0 when a wear-out (condition/high-vibration) fault is repaired or the unit is serviced; a random jam breakdown clears without resetting it. This is the wear clock behind speed loss and vibration, not a shift counter.
Initial     : 0
Writable    : False
